sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Shell as Shell or script
    participant Run as pipeline.Run<br/>internal/api/cli/pipeline/cli.go
    participant Action as pipeline.Command<br/>internal/api/cli/pipeline/command.go
    participant Binding as endpoint.ItemsHandler<br/>internal/api/cli/endpoint/items.go
    participant Handler as PlanItemsHandler<br/>internal/command/plan_items.go

    Shell->>+Run: todo items plan --title ...
    Note over Run: parses the arguments, logs the run
    Run->>+Action: the action of the resource
    Action->>+Binding: reads the flags
    Binding-->>-Action: PlanItems
    Action->>+Handler: PlanItems, through the command middleware
    Handler-->>-Action: the result, or an error with its kind
    Note over Action: writes json or text to stdout
    Action-->>-Run: nil, or the error
    Note over Run: the error to stderr, logs the end of the run
    Run-->>-Shell: the exit code: 0, 2 for invalid, 1 for a failure
